{
  "category": "Long Leg Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "It spins string not only from its rear but also from its mouth. It is hard to tell which end is which.",
      "version": "gold"
    },
    {
      "text": "A single strand of a special string is endlessly spun out of its rear. The string leads back to its nest.",
      "version": "silver"
    },
    {
      "text": "Rather than making a nest in one specific spot, it wanders in search of food after darkness falls.",
      "version": "crystal"
    },
    {
      "text": "ARIADOS’s feet are tipped with tiny hooked claws that enable it to scuttle on ceilings and vertical walls. This POKéMON constricts the foe with thin and strong silk webbing.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
    {
